Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libglib2.0-bin, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Description: Erik OS visual identity, wallpapers and theme tool
 Erik OS wallpapers, logo and GNOME default settings, plus the
 erik-theme command and the Erik Appearance app for listing, applying
 and resetting them. The app opens after the first login and is
 updated through apt together with this package.
 .
 All files in this package are original Erik OS work licensed
